      },
      {
        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "In a pan, heat up half the olive oil and the full amount of the coconut oil. Once it is hot, add some chicken to fry. Continue frying them, flipping them over when needed to create a crust. You don’t want to cook them all the way through, because they’ll be cooking in the oven later.",
        "name": "In a pan, heat up half the olive oil and the full amount of the coconut oil. Once it is hot, add some chicken to fry. Continue frying them, flipping them over when needed to create a crust. You don’t want to cook them all the way through, because they’ll be cooking in the oven later.",
        "url": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-bites-general-tsos-chicken/#wprm-recipe-50649-step-0-8",
