      },
      {
        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "Mix the sauce and the chicken well, but be careful – you don’t want the batter to peel off. Put the chicken in the oven for 60 minutes. Every 15 minutes you’ll be taking it out to flip the chicken. After 15 minutes there should not be much change; stir the chicken and make sure every piece has sauce.",
        "name": "Mix the sauce and the chicken well, but be careful – you don’t want the batter to peel off. Put the chicken in the oven for 60 minutes. Every 15 minutes you’ll be taking it out to flip the chicken. After 15 minutes there should not be much change; stir the chicken and make sure every piece has sauce.",
        "url": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-bites-general-tsos-chicken/#wprm-recipe-50649-step-0-13",
        "image": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2013/12/general_tso_chicken-18-15min.jpg"
      },
      {
        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "After 30 minutes you can see that the sauce has started to thicken. Continue to mix the sauce and the chicken, flipping the chicken pieces if needed.",
        "name": "After 30 minutes you can see that the sauce has started to thicken. Continue to mix the sauce and the chicken, flipping the chicken pieces if needed.",
        "url": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-bites-general-tsos-chicken/#wprm-recipe-50649-step-0-14",
