      },
      {
        "@type": "HowToStep",
        "text": "After 45 minutes you see that it’s almost done. Flip the chicken and cook another 15 minutes.",
        "name": "After 45 minutes you see that it’s almost done. Flip the chicken and cook another 15 minutes.",
